      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. regarding the viscosity part, we're seeing some weird patterns in the mid-day heat where the cracks seem to widen more than our models predicted. id say the binder is behaving almost erratically. is there any specific chemical degradation or unexpected phase change in the bitumen that could cause such sudden shifts in stability under these extreme desert temps?",
